'''St. Dober''' (天使ドーヴエル, ''Tenshi Dōvueru'', '''Angel Dovuer''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Dober P.D]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]].

