==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]], his English description mistakenly described his ability as [[Savage Blow|Savage Blows]] instead of Surge Attacks.
*St. Dober's description refers to the story of [[wikipedia:Hachikō|Hachikō]], a Japanese Akita Inu who waited at the train station everyday for his owner even after the latter's death, until he died of disease as well. Hachikō's loyalty led to his popularization even long after death.
*Since "L" and "R" are homophones in Japanese, St. Dober's Japanese name (天使ドーヴエル ''Tenshi Dōvueru'') can be taken as "Angel Dovuer" or "Angel Dovuel". "El" is the Hebrew word for God, commonly used as a suffix in angel names, and "uel" may be a reference to the prophet [[wikipedia:Samuel|Samuel]] or the angels [[wikipedia:Raguel|Raguel]] and [[wikipedia:Phanuel|Phanuel]].
*St. Dober still has eyes in his spritesheet, despite his heavenly hairdo covering it in all of his animations.

